        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Danball Senki is a PSP game developed by Level 5 involving small plastic model robots known as LBXs (standing for \"Little Battler eXperience\") that fight on dioramas made out of cardboard, and the main character Ban Yamano setting out to battle against LBXs created by other characters. For international release, Level-5 adopted the English language title \"Little Battlers eXperience.\"",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Danball Senki es un juego de PSP desarrollado por Level 5 que gira en torno a pequeños robots de plástico conocidos como LBX (siglas de «Little Battler eXperience»), que luchan sobre escenarios de cartón, y al protagonista, Ban Yamano, que se propone combatir contra los LBX creados por otros personajes. Para su lanzamiento internacional, Level-5 adoptó el título en inglés «Little Battlers eXperience».",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2011",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
